{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]The church has [G]one [D]founda[A7]tion [D]'Tis [Em]Jesus [D]Christ [A7]her [D]Lord;
[A7]She [D]is His [F#7]new cre[Gsus]a [G]tion [D]by [Bm]wa[A]ter [D]and [E7]the [A]Word.
[A]From [D]heaven [A7]He [D]came [G]and sought [D]her [Bm]to be his ho[B]ly [Em]bride;
[A]With [D]His own [G]blood [D]He [Gmaj7]bought [Em]her, [G]and [Em7]for her [D]life [A7]He [D]died.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D][G][D]Elect [A7][D]from [Em][D]every [A7][D]nation,
[A7][D]yet [F#7][Gsus]one [G][D]o'er [Bm][A]all [D][E7]the [A]earth;
[A][D][A7]her [D][G]charter [D][Bm]of [B][Em]salvation,
[A][D]one [G][D]Lord, [Gmaj7][Em]one [G][Em7]faith, [D][A7]one [D]birth;
